OL,3,GNEWSAAnglian Water to appear in court
OL,4,Aover dead fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water is due to appear in court
OL,7,Fover an alleged pollution incident
OL,8,Fwhere some 900 fish were found dead in
OL,9,Fa dyke.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency confirmed it was
OL,12,Fprosecuting the water company after it
OL,13,Finvestigated potential offences at
OL,14,FKing's Delph, in The Fens near
OL,15,FPeterborough, in September 2024.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
