OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAnglian Water to appear in court
OL,4,Aover dead fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Barclay, Conservative MP for
OL,7,FNorth East Cambridgeshire, said legal
OL,8,Fproceedings were a "welcome
OL,9,Fdevelopment" after "residents, anglers
OL,10,Fand community groups were
OL,11,Funderstandably concerned" after the
OL,12,Fappearance of the floating fish in the
OL,13,Fwaterway between Stanground and
OL,14,FWhittlesey.
OL,16,FThe case is due at Chelmsford
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court on 28 January.
OL,18,FAnglian Water has been contacted for
OL,19,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
